&lt;div class=&quot;diamond-part&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;danger-diamond&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/classification-committee-memo&quot;&gt;备忘录链接&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;arrows&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
