&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这还是个孩子！还是个孩子！——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6114202&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606375597&quot; alt=&quot;Frozen starry sky&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6114202)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky&quot;  &gt;Frozen starry sky&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我永远都是A老师的忠诚铁粉（○｀ 3′○）馅饼酱你还欠我一局文明6ヽ(✿ﾟ▽ﾟ)ノ——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aetherium&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5657018&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606375597&quot; alt=&quot;aetherium&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5657018)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aetherium&quot;  &gt;aetherium&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;饼子做我女朋友！——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6455279&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606375597&quot; alt=&quot;Raidwine&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6455279)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine&quot;  &gt;Raidwine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;已否决&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;《阿拉伯机械帝国史》，历史控深深得满足ing——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606375597&quot; alt=&quot;Confucian Lee&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;Confucian Lee&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;所有平台上的消息我应该都会在七天内回复，如果有超过14天和三个平台都没有回话的话（除去某些我事先说过的特殊原因）那应该是人死了，麻烦互相通知一下，之后就不要来找我了，毕竟那时候我也没办法跟你们说了。勿念（&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;啊喂也没人会念吧（&lt;/span&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606375597&quot; alt=&quot;Auroriaaaaa&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa&quot;  &gt;Auroriaaaaa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
