						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" style="display: none;" name="typeFrame"></iframe></p> <hr /> <p>这里是门罗，或者更女性化一点叫扪萝。入站一年多大概还是第一次说出自己的名字（写文不写自己人设，id名字又长又难记，难怪会变小透明啊。）</p> <p>在精进过技术后，我终于画出四张正儿八经的人设像素画<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-291293-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>，于是有了这个艺作页。与通常见到的像素画可能不大一样，我更倾向于将它作为一种方便的上色方式。</p> <p>希望你会喜欢。</p> <hr /> <p><br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Joanne:&nbsp;魔法奏乐</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">早期作品，算是黑历史了，凿海对不起啊……</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/zokhoi/Joanne-by-Monroe-Products.png" alt="Joanne-by-Monroe-Products.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;柿饼企鹅:&nbsp;夜间行动</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">大概……头上的企鹅形象还是挺明显吧？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/monroe-products/2974DEA8-FCF6-4790-9006-C378903F15C9.jpeg" alt="2974DEA8-FCF6-4790-9006-C378903F15C9.jpeg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+极光娅：圣诞快乐&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">好孩子会在睡醒时发现圣诞老人留下的礼物</a></di