						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wuhu-horse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4092253&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606375598" alt="WuHu Horse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4092253)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wuhu-horse" >WuHu Horse</a></span><br /> 一起回到，那诡异的家乡。</p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cn cdver2" style="width: 100%;height: 0;padding-bottom: calc(50% / 3);background-position: center; background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%